message.card_expired:
Hello {name}, we tried to renew your {plan} plan but the card we have on file has expired, so the latest payment didn't go through. There's nothing to worry about - your service is still running for now. Whenever you have a moment, just update your card and we'll handle the rest in one click. Reply here anytime if you'd like a hand.

Warmly,
{business}

message.insufficient_funds:
Hello {name}, a quick heads-up: your most recent {plan} payment didn't clear, and it looks like a temporary funding hiccup rather than anything wrong with your card. Your account stays active, so there's nothing urgent to do. We'll automatically retry in a few days - and if it'd help, just reply and we can sort out timing or options together.

Thanks for being with us,
{business}

message.generic_decline:
Hello {name}, we weren't able to process your {plan} renewal - the bank declined the charge without a specific reason, which usually points to a temporary hold on their side. Your service is still on, so nothing changes for now. It often helps to give your bank a quick check or try another card, and we'll retry shortly either way. Reach out anytime.

Best,
{business}

message.issuer_do_not_retry:
Hello {name}, your latest {plan} payment didn't go through, and your bank has asked us not to try this card again, so we won't. Your service is still running for now. When you have a moment, please add a different card or payment method and the payment will go through from there. If you'd rather sort it out with your bank first, that works too. Reply here if anything is unclear.

Best,
{business}

message.card_details_invalid:
Hello {name}, your latest {plan} payment didn't go through because some of the card details we have on file don't match what your bank expects. Your service is still running for now. When you have a moment, please re-enter your card details, or add a different card, and the payment will go through from there. Reply here if you need a hand.

Best,
{business}

message.direct_debit_not_retried:
Hello {name}, the direct debit for your latest {plan} payment didn't go through, and it won't be collected again automatically. Your service is still running for now. When you have a moment, please pay the open invoice or set up your direct debit again, and you're all sorted. Reply here if anything is unclear.

Best,
{business}

message.retries_exhausted:
Hello {name}, we've tried your {plan} payment several times now and it still hasn't gone through, so we've stopped trying this card. When you have a moment, please add a new card or payment method and your subscription will carry on from there. Reply here if anything is unclear.

Best,
{business}

fallback.message:
Hello {name}, we ran into a problem renewing your {plan} plan and the latest payment didn't go through. Your service is still active - when you have a moment, please check or update your payment method and we'll retry. Reply here if you need anything.

Best,
{business}
